<title>INDIA: India TISCO 96/97 results on May 23.</title>
<headline>India TISCO 96/97 results on May 23.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest private steel maker Tata Iron and Steel Company Ltd said on Friday its board will meet on May 23 to finalise accounts and recommend dividend for the year ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
